---
import Layout from "../../components/Layout.astro";
---
<!-- TODO: have this reviewed before applying to AdSense; keep it in line with the root site's policy. -->
<Layout lang="en" title="Privacy policy | Baitaan" description="How we handle your data and which cookies Baitaan Tools uses.">
  <article class="space-y-4 leading-relaxed text-ink">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink">Privacy policy</h1>
    <p>Our tools run in your browser. The numbers you type and the files you choose are not sent to our servers.</p>

    <h2 class="pt-2 text-xl font-semibold text-ink">Cookies</h2>
    <p>We use these cookies. <code>bt_theme</code> and <code>bt_consent</code> are shared with baitaandessigns.com and its other subdomains; <code>bt_lang</code> applies to this site only.</p>
    <div class="overflow-x-auto">
      <table class="w-full text-sm">
        <thead><tr class="text-muted"><th class="py-2 text-start font-medium">Cookie</th><th class="py-2 text-start font-medium">What it does</th><th class="py-2 text-start font-medium">Lasts</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr class="border-t border-hair"><td class="py-2 font-mono">bt_theme</td><td>Remembers whether you chose the light or dark theme.</td><td>1 year</td></tr>
          <tr class="border-t border-hair"><td class="py-2 font-mono">bt_lang</td><td>Remembers whether you chose Arabic or English on this site.</td><td>1 year</td></tr>
          <tr class="border-t border-hair"><td class="py-2 font-mono">bt_consent</td><td>Stores your cookie choice.</td><td>6 months</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
    <p>These three are necessary and are not used to identify you. Google's cookies are only used if you accept them: Google Analytics to measure visits, and Google AdSense to personalise ads. If you reject them, you may still see non-personalised ads.</p>
    <p>You can change your choice at any time with the “Cookie settings” link at the bottom of every page. Learn how Google uses data at <a class="text-link underline" href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites">policies.google.com</a>.</p>

    <h2 class="pt-2 text-xl font-semibold text-ink">Contact</h2>
    <p>salam@baitaandessigns.com</p>
  </article>
</Layout>
